ining</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">mystery</span><span class=\"tok-p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"tok-w\">    </span><span class=\"tok-sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A line from the mystery monster to its nearest neighbor.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">near</span> <span class=\"tok-o\">=</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">nearest</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">training</span><span class=\"tok-p\">,</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">mystery</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">penup</span><span class=\"tok-p\">();</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">goto</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-o\">*</span><span class=\"tok-n\">to_screen</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-o\">*</span><span class=\"tok-n\">mystery</span><span class=\"tok-p\">));</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">pendown</span><span class=\"tok-p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">pensize</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">2</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">goto</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-o\">*</span><span class=\"tok-n\">to_screen</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-n\">near</span><span class=\"tok-p\">[</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">0</span><span class=\"tok-p\">],</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">near</span><span class=\"tok-p\">[</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">1</span><span class=\"tok-p\">]))</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-n\">t</span><span class=\"tok-o\">.</span><span class=\"tok-n\">pensize</span><span class=\"tok-p\">(</span><span class=\"tok-mi\">1</span><span class=\"tok-p\">)</span>\n\n\n<span class